"P1587836508" "This day just gets better and better!<br><br>First, the whole raid last night went south and some people got killed. Then, this morning, the dumb as dirt media decides it would be a good idea to report on it and now a riot's broken out here in the Magisterium! To top it all off, Calvin Scott escaped custody and now there's <color orange>a hostage situation in the court house.</color><br><br>I need you to get in there and rescue those hostages before someone gets killed."
// AcceptString :
"P1473376322" "I Accept"
// SendOffString :
"P1538797947" "You know, I'd go in there and do it myself, I even have half a mind to do it anyway, but Cleo is right. I'd end up killing every one of those gutless fools in there and that wouldn't do us any favors with the media."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4247534353" "Rescue Hostages in the Court House"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3612115817" "You need to get that thing taken care off we talked about earlier."

