"P3816988655" "{HeroName}. You didn't get yourself killed. Good job. <br><br>These guys knew they were on a one way ticket into that court house. Damn fools are fighting for the wrong side! I'd strangle my own mother for dedication like that, and here I am in charge of a damn peace corps who ain't fought a fair fight in their lives!<br><br>I got the feeling that is all about to change, {HeroName}, and not for the better..."

